  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Experience Replay Buffer** by following direct mathematical principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\ndef rl_experience_replay_buffer(capacity: int, transitions_to_push: list, sample_size: int) -> dict:\n    buf, ptr, cap = [], 0, int(capacity)\n    for t in transitions_to_push:\n        if len(buf) < cap: buf.append(t)\n        else: buf[ptr] = t; ptr = (ptr + 1) % cap\n    return {'buffer_size': len(buf), 'sampled_batch': buf[:min(int(sample_size), len(buf))], 'is_full': len(buf) == cap}\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the size of the primary input.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
